{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0129-s001", "text": "Om familjen har barn under 18 år och äktenskapet slutar ska föräldrarna i samband med skilsmässan komma överens om följande:", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vardnad/narration-resume-20261103T045104144477Z/hb-c09-u0129-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 12.678095238095239, "peak": 0.353118896484375, "generation_seconds": 44.830439537996426, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0130-s001", "text": "Var ska barnet bo?", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vardnad/narration-resume-20261103T045104144477Z/hb-c09-u0130-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 2.2987755102040817, "peak": 0.321746826171875, "generation_seconds": 15.576225159922615, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0132-s001", "text": "Vem är barnets vårdnadshavare?", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vardnad/narration-resume-20261103T045104144477Z/hb-c09-u0132-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.0650340136054424, "peak": 0.26885986328125, "generation_seconds": 13.156971313990653, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0133-s001", "text": "Hur ordnas umgänget?", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vardnad/narration-resume-20261103T045104144477Z/hb-c09-u0133-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 2.2987755102040817, "peak": 0.225189208984375, "generation_seconds": 10.755561956902966, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0134-s001", "text": "Underhållsbidrag.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vardnad/narration-resume-20261103T045104144477Z/hb-c09-u0134-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 2.2291156462585033, "peak": 0.3338623046875, "generation_seconds": 9.722277306951582, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0135-s001", "text": "När föräldrarna har kommit överens om barnets boende, vårdnad, umgängesrätt och underhållsbidrag kan barnatillsyningsmannen (lastenvalvoja) på din ort bekräfta avtalet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vardnad/narration-resume-20261103T045104144477Z/hb-c09-u0135-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 14.419591836734694, "peak": 0.322235107421875, "generation_seconds": 53.34343164716847, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0135-s002", "text": "När barnatillsyningsmannen bekräftar avtalet är det lika officiellt som ett domstolsbeslut.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vardnad/narration-resume-20261103T045104144477Z/hb-c09-u0135-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.080544217687075, "peak": 0.25726318359375, "generation_seconds": 27.420488288858905, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0136-s001", "text": "Om ni inte kan komma överens om boende, vårdnad, umgänge och underhåll kan ni ansöka om medling i familjefrågor (perheasioiden sovittelu).", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vardnad/narration-resume-20261103T045104144477Z/hb-c09-u0136-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 12.051156462585034, "peak": 0.273529052734375, "generation_seconds": 37.39689547708258, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0136-s002", "text": "Om ni inte får fram ett avtal där heller, måste ni låta tingsrätten lösa tvisten.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vardnad/narration-resume-20261103T045511401200Z/hb-c09-u0136-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.314285714285714, "peak": 0.27996826171875, "generation_seconds": 21.57503373315558, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0136-s003", "text": "Domstolen tar hänsyn till barnets intressen och dess egna önskemål.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vardnad/narration-resume-20261103T045511401200Z/hb-c09-u0136-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.851428571428571, "peak": 0.307220458984375, "generation_seconds": 19.222499212017283, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0137-s001", "text": "Låt alltid barnets intressen gå först när ni beslutar om boendet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vardnad/narration-resume-20261103T045511401200Z/hb-c09-u0137-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.7817687074829935, "peak": 0.28131103515625, "generation_seconds": 21.64480610913597, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0138-s001", "text": "Officiellt kan ett barn bara bo på ett ställe.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vardnad/narration-resume-20261103T045511401200Z/hb-c09-u0138-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.249251700680272, "peak": 0.267364501953125, "generation_seconds": 18.22002501320094, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0138-s002", "text": "Vid skilsmässa kommer man överens om hos vilken förälder barnet har sin officiella adress.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vardnad/narration-resume-20261103T045511401200Z/hb-c09-u0138-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.150204081632653, "peak": 0.259735107421875, "generation_seconds": 25.93119819299318, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0139-s001", "text": "I praktiken kan barnet dock bo en del av tiden hos sin andra förälder.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vardnad/narration-resume-20261103T045511401200Z/hb-c09-u0139-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.199727891156463, "peak": 0.280303955078125, "generation_seconds": 20.80765420687385, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0140-s001", "text": "Barnbidraget betalas till den förälder hos vilken barnet bor officiellt.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vardnad/narration-resume-20261103T045511401200Z/hb-c09-u0140-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.2693877551020405, "peak": 0.31512451171875, "generation_seconds": 23.391157489968464, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0140-s002", "text": "Barnets officiella adress påverkar också till exempel FPA:s bostadsbidrag.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vardnad/narration-resume-20261103T045511401200Z/hb-c09-u0140-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.314285714285714, "peak": 0.287139892578125, "generation_seconds": 24.762771555921063, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0141-s001", "text": "Vårdnaden om ett barn innebär", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vardnad/narration-resume-20261103T045838603232Z/hb-c09-u0141-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.0650340136054424, "peak": 0.281982421875, "generation_seconds": 10.985495894914493, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0142-s001", "text": "att man tar hand om barnet", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vardnad/narration-resume-20261103T045838603232Z/hb-c09-u0142-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 2.8560544217687074, "peak": 0.45941162109375, "generation_seconds": 10.52642713394016, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0144-s001", "text": "att man uppfostrar barnet", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vardnad/narration-resume-20261103T045838603232Z/hb-c09-u0144-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 2.8560544217687074, "peak": 0.446197509765625, "generation_seconds": 10.10615878016688, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0145-s001", "text": "att man tar hand om och beslutar om barnets angelägenheter.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vardnad/narration-resume-20261103T045838603232Z/hb-c09-u0145-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.50312925170068, "peak": 0.4281005859375, "generation_seconds": 17.21729151601903, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0146-s001", "text": "När ett äktenskap slutar beslutar barnets föräldrar hur vårdnaden ska ordnas.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vardnad/narration-resume-20261103T045838603232Z/hb-c09-u0146-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.965986394557823, "peak": 0.29742431640625, "generation_seconds": 23.708422963973135, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0146-s002", "text": "Föräldrarna kan komma överens om gemensam vårdnad eller om att den ena föräldern har ensam vårdnad.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vardnad/narration-resume-20261103T045838603232Z/hb-c09-u0146-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.846802721088435, "peak": 0.292572021484375, "generation_seconds": 24.687119224108756, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0146-s003", "text": "Vårdnaden är inte beroende av vem barnet bor med.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vardnad/narration-resume-20261103T045838603232Z/hb-c09-u0146-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.458231292517007, "peak": 0.2764892578125, "generation_seconds": 14.593262328999117, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0147-s001", "text": "När båda föräldrarna är barnets vårdnadshavare, alltså när de har gemensam vårdnad, beslutar de många saker tillsammans.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vardnad/narration-resume-20261103T045838603232Z/hb-c09-u0147-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.448979591836734, "peak": 0.333587646484375, "generation_seconds": 30.373089659959078, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0147-s002", "text": "Dessa är barnets", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vardnad/narration-resume-20261103T050123290268Z/hb-c09-u0147-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 2.2987755102040817, "peak": 0.328826904296875, "generation_seconds": 9.131350346840918, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c09-u0148-s001", "text": "namn", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c09-vardnad/narration-resume-20261103T050123290268Z/hb-c09-u0148-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 1.4628571428571429, "peak": 0.324920654296875, "generation_seconds": 7.197834288934246, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
